---
---
<section
  id="hero"
  class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center text-center px-6"
  style="background: linear-gradient(140deg, #0f0f1e 0%, #1a1a2e 50%, #0f3460 100%)"
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 text-accent
                text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-5 py-2 rounded-full mb-8">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse"></span>
      100% kostenlos · 1 Monat
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-5">
      Ich mache dein Marketing –<br />
      <span class="text-accent">einen Monat lang gratis.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-lg mx-auto mb-10">
      Du konzentrierst dich auf die Arbeit auf der Baustelle.<br />
      Ich kümmere mich um alles, was neue Kunden bringt.
    </p>

    <a
      href="#cta"
      class="inline-block bg-accent text-primary font-extrabold text-base px-10 py-4
             rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(232,184,75,0.35)]
             hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(232,184,75,0.45)]
             transition-all duration-200"
    >
      Jetzt kostenlos mitmachen →
    </a>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-10 mt-16">
      {[
        { num: '+5–10',    lbl: 'neue Google-Bewertungen' },
        { num: '12×',      lbl: 'Posts im Monat' },
        { num: '0 €',      lbl: 'Kosten für dich' },
      ].map(s => (
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-accent">{s.num}</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">{s.lbl}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
